\title{The membrane equation}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{The voltage in \ref{fnip-0005} changes because current crosses the
membrane. The same kind of balance, with one current for each ionic
path, is the voltage equation of the conductance-based model.}

\p{Which currents cross a membrane whose voltage is one function of
time, and which equation governs #{\dot V}?}

